  "label": "User projected onto the humorous interpretation of the scene",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the scene where the person is loading the dishwasher into the back of the moving truck, interpreting the text 'solid move' as a humorous commentary on the action. The user is not explicitly addressed with deictic pronouns like 'you' or 'me', but the meme invites the viewer to share in the joke, projecting the user's own understanding and amusement onto the visual and textual material.",
